      "text": "# dsh-search-boost bundle layer: mount the search plugin and route the web\n# seam's search AND fetch capabilities to it. The base layer pins\n# `searchProvider: deepseek-official` (and possibly fetchProvider); a patch row\n# replaces the targeted row's whole config. A later profile patch can pin any\n# provider back (e.g. `deepseek-official`).\n- id: web\n  config:\n    searchProvider: dsh-search-boost\n    fetchProvider: dsh-search-boost\n\n- insert:\n    - id: dsh-search-boost\n      name: dsh-search-boost\n"
